DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     bbhhyyvvee is a virtual machine monitor that is hosted by FreeBSD.  It is used
     to host unmodified guest operating systems on top of FreeBSD.

     bbhhyyvvee relies heavily on hardware assist provided by the CPU and chipset
     to virtualize processor and memory resources.

